{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>ושא</b> — three times. ושא את מספר שמותם. ושא עיניך ימה וצפונה. And the third: ראה עניי ועמלי ושא לכל חטאתי. For David prayed concerning the fact that he counted the number of Israel, and this is ושא את מספר שמותם, and one who prays must direct his eyes downward, and this is ושא עיניך ימה — that he directs his eyes downward and does not raise his eyes upward:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:07.551227275Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}